    "title": "Hazmat chemical leak in Estacada prompts brief evacuations; no longer a threat to safety - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff ,\n10 hours ago ESTACADA, Ore. (KATU) — A hazardous chemical leak in Estacada on Wednesday morning prompted emergency officials to evacuate everyone nearby for more than an hour. According to Estacada Fire, a 55-gallon drum of a “volatile chemical” was venting at 30395 Veterans Way in Estacada, off of Highway 211 near River Mill Road. They announced the incident at about 10:45 a.m. Read full article\n1",
